savar/
# Vendored parameter-decomposition lab (its own repo/CLAUDE.md; ~9 GB)
param-decomp/

# ── Large generated data (regenerate with data_gen/) ─────────────────────────
data/

# ── SAE activations / per-experiment SAE data (regenerate with sae/) ─────────
